xt-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            山形・天童温泉「ほほえみの宿 滝の湯」の山形牛会席とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 契約牧場直送の山形牛や米沢牛を目の前で焼き上げる炭火ステーキやしゃぶしゃぶで贅沢に味わえます。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ 仙台牛・とちぎ和牛が美味しいおすすめ温泉宿10選】湯西川温泉 本家伴久 〜時空を・塩原温泉 湯守田中屋など楽天トラベル高評価の名宿を徹底比較とあわせて読みたい厳選旅行ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900\">💎 テーマ別おすすめ特集</h4>\n      <a href=\"/posts/fireplace-woodstove-luxury-resort-hotels-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700\">👉 暖炉・薪ストーブがあるおすすめ高級ホテル10選</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/charcoal-hearth-sendai-tochigi-wagyu-hotels-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700\">👉 仙台牛・とちぎ和牛が美味しいおすすめ宿10選</a>\n      <a href=\"/posts/weakly-acidic-gentle-astringent-beauty-hotels-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover:text-amber-700\">👉 弱酸性泉が自慢のおすすめ美肌温泉宿10選</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900\">🎌 日本各地・注目の旅特集</h4>\n      <a href=\"/posts/yamanashi-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 hover: